BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 679.0 Tm (The inode bitmap identifies used inodes, and the zone bitmap tracks allocated data regions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 662.0 Tm (Directories map names to inode numbers through fixed-layout version-specific entries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 645.0 Tm (Original V1 name variants permitted short directory names, while later versions increased) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628.0 Tm (name capacity. Record width must be selected from the actual format variant; treating a V1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 611.0 Tm (directory as V3 misaligns every following entry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (File size and zone pointers must be checked against declared geometry and file-block) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 565.0 Tm (coverage. Hard links affect inode reference counts independently of data-zone ownership.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 548.0 Tm (Sparse-file or indirect-block behaviour, where permitted, must be validated with the exact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 531.0 Tm (version and system implementation.) Tj ET
